{"id":"n31805-3-7","stage":2,"title":"제자리 · 原位","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31805-3-7-1","ko":"새로 옮긴 직장은 어때?","zh":"新工作的环境怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"옮긴","meaning":"搬，换，调，迁移","explanation":"옮기다：搬，换，调，迁移；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"10","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮긴","audio":"/audio/6e196c3cd76237dd7027.mp3"}},{"text":"직장은","meaning":"工作单位，职场","explanation":"직장：工作单位，职场；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"1","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직장은","audio":"/audio/e7b951c968282e8f86a8.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"重新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"与以前不同，全新地；或用新的。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，换，调，迁移","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"将原来的住所、所属等换成别的。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]},{"id":"fdfb4ffae29b3def","term":"직장","zh":"工作单位，职场","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3","entryId":"58297","definition":"指收取报酬而上班的地方。","pronunciation":["직짱"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c53293f3aa8bb1d178e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31805-3-7-2","ko":"이제야 제자리를 찾은 기분이야.","zh":"现在总算找到属于自己的位置了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제야","meaning":"这才","explanation":"이제야：这才","readings":[{"term":"이제야","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24993","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제야","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3"}},{"text":"제자리를","meaning":"原位，原地，原处","explanation":"제자리：原位，原地，原处；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"제자리","audio":"/audio/4f194a2e0e6b13de37f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31805","senseId":"3","lemma":"제자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제자리를","audio":"/audio/014b5fb211e9496eb871.mp3"}},{"text":"찾은","meaning":"找，追求，谋求","explanation":"찾다：找，追求，谋求；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"7","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾은","audio":"/audio/8a1928bf0d7b8b4fc94a.mp3"}},{"text":"기분이야.","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기분이야","audio":"/audio/0ac18b71ef9e868d274f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2be18ec567b0073f","term":"이제야","zh":"这才","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3","entryId":"24993","definition":"说话的当时才。","pronunciation":["이제야"]},{"id":"4f194a2e0e6b13de","term":"제자리","zh":"原位，原地，原处","audio":"/audio/4f194a2e0e6b13de37f7.mp3","entryId":"31805","definition":"应该在的地方。","pronunciation":["제자리"]},{"id":"0aa1